{"architectures":["x64"],"id":"ten-framework.tman","latestVersion":"0.11.74","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"TEN Framework Package Manager","license":"Apache 2.0 with certain conditions","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/TEN-framework/ten-framework/blob/main/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"TEN Framework Package Manager","license":"Apache 2.0 with certain conditions","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/TEN-framework/ten-framework/blob/main/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"tman is the official package manager for the TEN Framework.\nIt helps developers manage extensions, protocols, and other TEN framework components.\nKey Features:\n- Install and manage TEN packages with ease\n- Automatic dependency resolution\n- Package version control and updates\n- Support for multiple package types (extensions, protocols, etc.)\n- Seamless integration with TEN Framework projects\nThe TEN Framework is a powerful framework for building real-time communication applications,\nand tman makes it easy to extend and customize your applications with community packages.","name":"tman","packageUrl":"https://github.com/TEN-framework/ten-framework","publisher":"TEN Framework Team","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/TEN-framework","tags":["package-manager","ten-framework","extension-manager","developer-tools","cli","ten"]},"ja-JP":{"description":"TEN Framework パッケージマネージャー","license":"Apache 2.0 with certain conditions","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/TEN-framework/ten-framework/blob/main/LICENSE","locale":"ja-JP","longDescription":"tmanはTEN Frameworkの公式パッケージマネージャーです。\n開発者が拡張機能、プロトコル、その他のTENフレームワークコンポーネントを管理するのに役立ちます。\n主な機能：\n- TENパッケージの簡単なインストールと管理\n- 自動依存関係解決\n- パッケージのバージョン管理と更新\n- 複数のパッケージタイプのサポート（拡張機能、プロトコルなど）\n- TEN Frameworkプロジェクトとのシームレスな統合\nTEN Frameworkはリアルタイム通信アプリケーションを構築するための強力なフレームワークであり、\ntmanを使用すると、コミュニティパッケージでアプリケーションを簡単に拡張およびカスタマイズできます。","name":"tman","packageUrl":"https://github.com/TEN-framework/ten-framework","publisher":"TEN Framework チーム","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/TEN-framework","tags":["package-manager","ten-framework","extension-manager","developer-tools","cli","ten"]},"ko-KR":{"description":"TEN Framework 패키지 관리자","license":"Apache 2.0 with certain conditions","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/TEN-framework/ten-framework/blob/main/LICENSE","locale":"ko-KR","longDescription":"tman은 TEN Framework의 공식 패키지 관리자입니다.\n개발자가 확장 기능, 프로토콜 및 기타 TEN 프레임워크 구성 요소를 관리하는 데 도움이 됩니다.\n주요 기능:\n- TEN 패키지를 쉽게 설치하고 관리\n- 자동 종속성 해결\n- 패키지 버전 제어 및 업데이트\n- 다양한 패키지 유형 지원 (확장 기능, 프로토콜 등)\n- TEN Framework 프로젝트와의 원활한 통합\nTEN Framework는 실시간 통신 애플리케이션 구축을 위한 강력한 프레임워크이며,\ntman을 사용하면 커뮤니티 패키지로 애플리케이션을 쉽게 확장하고 사용자 지정할 수 있습니다.","name":"tman","packageUrl":"https://github.com/TEN-framework/ten-framework","publisher":"TEN Framework 팀","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/TEN-framework","tags":["package-manager","ten-framework","extension-manager","developer-tools","cli","ten"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"TEN Framework 包管理器","license":"Apache 2.0 with certain conditions","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/TEN-framework/ten-framework/blob/main/LICENSE","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"tman 是 TEN Framework 的官方包管理器。\n它帮助开发者管理扩展、协议和其他 TEN 框架组件。\n主要特性：\n- 轻松安装和管理 TEN 包\n- 自动依赖解析\n- 包版本控制和更新\n- 支持多种包类型（扩展、协议等）\n- 与 TEN Framework 项目无缝集成\nTEN Framework 是一个强大的实时通信应用框架，\ntman 让您可以轻松扩展和定制应用程序。","name":"tman","packageUrl":"https://github.com/TEN-framework/ten-framework","publisher":"TEN Framework 团队","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/TEN-framework","tags":["package-manager","ten-framework","extension-manager","developer-tools","cli","ten"]},"zh-TW":{"description":"TEN Framework 套件管理器","license":"Apache 2.0 with certain conditions","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/TEN-framework/ten-framework/blob/main/LICENSE","locale":"zh-TW","longDescription":"tman 是 TEN Framework 的官方套件管理器。\n它幫助開發者管理擴充套件、通訊協定和其他 TEN 框架元件。\n主要特性：\n- 輕鬆安裝和管理 TEN 套件\n- 自動相依性解析\n- 套件版本控制和更新\n- 支援多種套件類型（擴充套件、通訊協定等）\n- 與 TEN Framework 專案無縫整合\nTEN Framework 是一個強大的即時通訊應用程式框架，\ntman 讓您可以輕鬆擴充和客製化應用程式。","name":"tman","packageUrl":"https://github.com/TEN-framework/ten-framework","publisher":"TEN Framework 團隊","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/TEN-framework","tags":["package-manager","ten-framework","extension-manager","developer-tools","cli","ten"]}},"longDescription":"tman is the official package manager for the TEN Framework.\nIt helps developers manage extensions, protocols, and other TEN framework components.\nKey Features:\n- Install and manage TEN packages with ease\n- Automatic dependency resolution\n- Package version control and updates\n- Support for multiple package types (extensions, protocols, etc.)\n- Seamless integration with TEN Framework projects\nThe TEN Framework is a powerful framework for building real-time communication applications,\nand tman makes it easy to extend and customize your applications with community packages.","name":"tman","packageUrl":"https://github.com/TEN-framework/ten-framework","publisher":"TEN Framework Team","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/TEN-framework","tags":["package-manager","ten-framework","extension-manager","developer-tools","cli","ten"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.11.74/app.json","detailSha256":"34ddbd70d14c2410ed69c1a20a52b93952e332f9bcd70ecce9020a9f1d01c043","version":"0.11.74"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.11.73/app.json","detailSha256":"ef10cd9aec198fd7ae87c331e61334d6b158d4e02e70883174a19d8610f3949c","version":"0.11.73"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.11.72/app.json","detailSha256":"a8b812d545825589cffd5b11aedb953b1506b68bf0508c92851a18984197181c","version":"0.11.72"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.11.71/app.json","detailSha256":"1c5e8e8f1f850e052d90f63aa7102a7efb2bb9eca834838a4fb4c589eb41ee81","version":"0.11.71"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.11.70/app.json","detailSha256":"23f3bd2235b5d8f5d2c2f820e